<title>UK: BayerLB sets 1.0 billion FRF 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 1.0 billion FRF 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Agricole.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    03.OCT.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.588    PAY DATE    03.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    99.588    SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
